WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:01.709
This is Qura.

2
00:00:01.709 --> 00:00:04.787
Every healthcare contract worth bidding for,

3
00:00:04.787 --> 00:00:06.535
the people who decide it,

4
00:00:06.535 --> 00:00:08.214
and the tools to win it.

5
00:00:08.214 --> 00:00:09.613
Here's how it works.

6
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:13.889
Opportunities brings live procurement

7
00:00:13.889 --> 00:00:15.606
notices into one list,

8
00:00:15.606 --> 00:00:17.168
refreshed every day.

9
00:00:17.168 --> 00:00:19.588
NHS and UK public sector first,

10
00:00:19.588 --> 00:00:21.384
then the United States,

11
00:00:21.384 --> 00:00:23.804
the European Union, and Canada.

12
00:00:23.804 --> 00:00:25.522
Filter to your market,

13
00:00:25.522 --> 00:00:27.943
and see what each one is worth,

14
00:00:27.943 --> 00:00:29.426
and when it closes.

15
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:32.193
Open any notice,

16
00:00:32.193 --> 00:00:35.920
and Tender Snapshot reads it for you. Value, term,

17
00:00:35.920 --> 00:00:39.722
deadline, what the buyer actually wants, and where.

18
00:00:39.722 --> 00:00:40.542
In seconds,

19
00:00:40.542 --> 00:00:41.810
not an afternoon.

20
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:46.114
Under every notice are the people who decide it,

21
00:00:46.114 --> 00:00:47.412
from your directory.

22
00:00:47.412 --> 00:00:49.358
Decision makers across trusts,

23
00:00:49.358 --> 00:00:50.656
boards and councils.

24
00:00:50.656 --> 00:00:53.186
And public sector intel reads the board

25
00:00:53.186 --> 00:00:55.327
papers and council announcements,

26
00:00:55.327 --> 00:00:56.689
so you don't have to.

27
00:00:58.200 --> 00:00:59.282
When you're ready,

28
00:00:59.282 --> 00:01:02.347
Propose drafts a tailored proposal from the notice.

29
00:01:02.347 --> 00:01:03.188
Save the deal,

30
00:01:03.188 --> 00:01:05.713
and track every bid through your pipeline.

31
00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:13.311
Hospitals see a rating for every workforce supplier,

32
00:01:13.311 --> 00:01:15.809
built from things Qura has checked.

33
00:01:15.809 --> 00:01:17.022
Framework places,

34
00:01:17.022 --> 00:01:18.235
CQC registration,

35
00:01:18.235 --> 00:01:19.805
evidenced specialties,

36
00:01:19.805 --> 00:01:21.803
and how quickly you respond.

37
00:01:23.400 --> 00:01:25.893
Qura is also where clinicians build one

38
00:01:25.893 --> 00:01:26.980
verified profile.

39
00:01:26.980 --> 00:01:29.218
A person checks every registration,

40
00:01:29.218 --> 00:01:31.136
so the talent you see is real,

41
00:01:31.136 --> 00:01:33.374
and roles reach the people who fit.

42
00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:35.526
Place SEND staff?

43
00:01:35.526 --> 00:01:37.978
SEND Intelligence shows every special

44
00:01:37.978 --> 00:01:40.165
school's vacancies, SEND tenders,

45
00:01:40.165 --> 00:01:42.285
and the councils under pressure,

46
00:01:42.285 --> 00:01:43.213
every morning.

47
00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:45.502
That's Qura.

48
00:01:45.502 --> 00:01:46.553
Find the work,

49
00:01:46.553 --> 00:01:47.830
know who decides,

50
00:01:47.830 --> 00:01:49.258
and win more of it.

51
00:01:49.258 --> 00:01:52.113
See it for yourself at qurahealth.org.

